# A group that does it as taught: the bearer tells, another gives the sign; the two not telling or doing gather the pieces.
deliverance: relay remember        # 0:00 "Lift the weight. Untuck the tail. Pull the tail, not the load."
remember: work                     # Remember's fingers at the cord; Deliverance lifts the weight
remember: work
waitstill: relay mindwell          # "Green. Once. Long." The medium writes it on the slate for the muffled guest.
mindwell: work                     # Mindwell's eyes pick the green pane; holds the lever for three
mindwell: work
mindwell: relay deliverance        # "Ear to the hearth. Three and one; answer two and two."
deliverance: work                  # Deliverance's ear to the hearth, waits for her knock, knocks two and two
deliverance: work
deliverance: work
remember: relay deliverance        # Remember has ordered the six pieces on the slate and points; Deliverance reads
remember: work                     # the last act: Remember's hands and eyes on the slate, Deliverance's voice
remember: work
